.TH ROLLDICE-GOROU 6 "2026-01-05" "rolldice-gorou 0.1.0"
.SH NAME
rolldice-gorou \- fully shuffled CLI music player
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rolldice-gorou
.I DIRECTORY
.SH DESCRIPTION
rolldice-gorou is a minimal CLI music player focused on true random shuffle.
It plays audio files in a directory in a completely random order using mpv.

Keyboard controls:
.TP
.B space
Pause / resume playback
.TP
.B n
Skip to next random track
.TP
.B q
Quit the player
.SH REQUIREMENTS
mpv, python
.SH AUTHOR
gorou

